- research/seo-aeo/2026-11-25-agentic-sdlc-target-queries-and-competitors -- intent-driven results have no vendor owner while the spec-driven and agentic-SDLC head terms are vendor-held and reachable only through comparison and definition pages; the six target queries and the page type each needs.
- research/article-writing/2026-11-22-article-types-structure-and-formatting -- front-loading (the first two paragraphs carry the key information), meaningful rather than clever headings, in-page links for long-form reading.
